{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7KmQ21mckwCzj4Hy3QX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before I draft, a few questions. Your answers will decide how the pitch handles its hardest part, which is that people in a town of 6,500 remember the 2022 closure and the refunded campaign.\n\n1. **What happens to people's money if you miss June 30?** Is it all-or-nothing with full refunds again? Does the bank's $25,000 disappear? And how much of the remaining $60,000 is already pledged, if any?\n2. **What's different from last time, apart from the lower target?** The obvious question is \"Why will this one work when $120,000 didn't?\" The $1 lease, the bank match and the 46 volunteers all help. Is there anything else? For example, the old campaign might have included costs you've since cut, you might have a named lead donor, or the town council or a business group might be backing it.\n3. **How will the cinema pay its way once it's open?** A reader will wonder why it closed at 180 tickets a week and why it will survive now. Do you know why it closed, and do you have rough running costs, ticket prices or a break-even attendance figure? Volunteer staff and no rent may be the answer, but I need your numbers to say so.\n4. **When would it reopen, and what will it show?** A target opening month helps, and so do first-run films, classics, kids' matinees, or school and community screenings.\n5. **What do backers get?** Reward tiers, founding-member passes or names on seats. Also, where is it hosted (Kickstarter, GoFundMe, your own site), and is the money tax-deductible?\n6. **Who signs it, and what are the cinema's and the group's names?** Also, is there any cost, risk or weak number I haven't been told about that locals already know or will find out? Examples would be the roof turning out worse than quoted or the owner's terms having conditions.\n\nIf you don't know some of these, say so and I'll write around them rather than guess."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":624,"cache_read_input_tokens":9516,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":624},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9667e3b7-7b64-485c-8579-c954d8cb443a","uuid":"f2483866-163c-4cdb-9818-b2e9dd58a914","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:34:09.118Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7KmPorkwBZunfmRkBQY"}
